ss=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청기간&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2018.11.14.(수</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) ~ 11.16.(금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span></font></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>신청방법</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장 직인(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">날인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) 득한</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;후 연계전공 이수 포기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">원을&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">공동실험실습관 201호에 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>신청장소</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">행정실&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\">공동실험실습관 201호</span>)</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>신청서류</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#f15f5f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">연계전공 포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청서 및 성적증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">원본</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">참고사항</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">문의사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\">공동실험실습관 201호</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ng\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ng\